DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Chicago Public Library\\nCost: free\\nAges: 0-60 mo
 nths\\nCategory: Storytime\\n\\nJoin us for a new discussion and trivia se
 ries aimed towards older adults\, led by local septuagenarians Steve Belli
 nger and Sue Garvey. It will be a fun hour of reminiscing about life in th
 e 50’s\, 60’s and maybe even the 70’s. We might show videos of old p
 rograms\, listen to music of the day\, or talk about what was big in the n
 ews. Let’s hear your memories of the era. Audience participation is stro
 ngly encouraged! October’s topic will be Games\, Hobbies\, and Collectib
 les: What We Did for Fun . Reg\\n\\nMore info: https://chipublib.bibliocom
 mons.com/events/6abd5e9c901b02002cbf0d97
LOCATION:Edgewater\, 6000 N. Broadway St.\, Chicago\, IL 60660
URL:https://chipublib.bibliocommons.com/events/6abd5e9c901b02002cbf0d97
