BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Field Nights: Boo with SUE
DTSTART;TZID=America/Chicago:20261030T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Chicago:20261030T210000
DTSTAMP:20261009T150201Z
UID:2c0d973bdcf2af9806811732888d58db@family-events-agent
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:museum,science,family,families
DESCRIPTION:Organizer: Field Museum - Events\\nCost: Ticket required\\nAge
 s: All ages\\nCategory: General\\n\\nTrick-or-treat yourself to a night at
  the Field Museum! This after hours Halloween party will be a scream for a
 ll ages. Whether you're a ghost\, ghoul\, or guest\, you'll have the oppor
 tunity to trick or treat with SUE and our team of scientists\, getting up 
 close and personal with spooky specimens from the museum's collections alo
 ng the way! Then\, enter the realm of nocturnal creatures and take on our 
 special walkthrough attraction\, Dioramas in the Dark. Your senses will be
  put to the test in a series of challenges and obstacles as the lights go 
 out and the “Dead Zoo” comes to life! Costumes encouraged! For the saf
 ety of all guests\, please do not wear costumes that cover your face or in
 clude prop weapons of any kind. Guests are encouraged to register in advan
 ce. All sales are final. Access to all museum exhibitions\, including the 
 Crown Family PlayLab \, Underground MisAdventure: Zombie Fungus! \, Pokemo
 n Fossil Museum \, and After the Age of Dinosaurs \, is included with admi
 ssion. Get your tickets for Boo with SUE below! Parking for Boo with SUE c
 an now be purchased in advance directly through Soldier Field - North Gara
 ge. Rates are subject to change for parking that is purchased upon your ar
 rival on the day of your event. Please purchase parking in advance by fol
 lowing this link and selecting Boo with SUE on October 30th. For all other
  questions\, please email us at familynights@fieldmuseum.org or call us at
  312.665.7525.\\n\\nMore info: https://www.fieldmuseum.org/our-events/fiel
 d-family-nights/family-field-nights-boo-with-sue
LOCATION:Field Museum\, 1400 S Lake Shore Dr\, Chicago\, IL 60605
URL:https://www.fieldmuseum.org/our-events/field-family-nights/family-fiel
 d-nights-boo-with-sue
